From: Fabrice Fontaine <fontaine.fabrice@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2020 23:44:08 +0100
Subject: [Buildroot] [PATCH 1/1] package/ipsec-tools: drop package
Message-ID: <20201113224408.1246899-1-fontaine.fabrice@gmail.com>
